wip/box64: Import box64-0.4.4

Box64 runs x86_64 Linux programs on ARM64 and RISC-V Linux, with
dynamic recompilation and native wrapping of common libraries.
Linux-only; built with the ARM64 dynarec as in the RenderMan VM.
Prebuilt x86_64 libraries and /etc files are not installed; the rc
file is read from PKG_SYSCONFDIR.

Tested with a pkgsrc bootstrap in a Fedora 43 aarch64 VM: x86_64
busybox and an AVX2/FMA test program run correctly.
